  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Scenic portrait hits Fang Yuan first. Genesis Lotus’ will then uses another painting path killer move, brush stroke. Ink-black injuries appear on Fang Yuan’s body and deepen quickly. He activates the compound killer move Man as Before and heals himself constantly. With that, he has no choice but to cancel rotting poisonous dark ash, which only leaves five restriction profound light qi for his counterattack.",
      "chapters": [
        2204
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the refinement path killer move refine self, Fang Yuan rests for a moment, then uses the compound killer move man as before. His injuries are fully healed and his arm is fully restored. When he exerts strength using that arm he still feels a sense of weakness from it, though this already satisfies him.",
      "chapters": [
        2215
      ],
